+/// TF_FLASHNEXT_TP_KEEP_BATCH=1 (--tp 2): rank 0 rolls a window back on its own GPU at once and sends rank 1 a round's
+/// rollbacks in one keep_many frame ahead of its next command, whose ack it reads with that command's; a keep that
+/// moves nothing (every row kept, the window already settled) sends nothing, and neither rank waits on its stream for
+/// a keep. Each window's rollback is the one the keep frame runs, in the same order before any later frame, so the bits
